      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندكّ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a place) <i>became levelled, its elevations and depressions being made even.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<i>It</i> (a camel's hump) <i>became spread upon the
animal's sides,</i> (TA,) or <i>upon his back.</i> (IDrd,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>It</i> (sand) <i>became compact.</i> (TA.)

